{"id":"n64729-1-16","stage":1,"title":"젖다 · 沾湿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64729-1-16-1","ko":"휴지가 물에 다 젖었네.","zh":"卫生纸全被水浸湿了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴지가","meaning":"卫生纸，手纸","explanation":"휴지：卫生纸，手纸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"휴지","audio":"/audio/2d0ab2df41b75912bfef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44797","senseId":"2","lemma":"휴지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물에","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"젖었네.","meaning":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","explanation":"젖다：沾湿，浸湿，润湿；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"젖다","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64729","senseId":"1","lemma":"젖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2d0ab2df41b75912","term":"휴지","zh":"卫生纸，手纸","audio":"/audio/2d0ab2df41b75912bfef.mp3","entryId":"44797","definition":"用来擦脏东西的薄纸。","pronunciation":["휴지"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5f61a84f921197b6","term":"젖다","zh":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3","entryId":"64729","definition":"液体渗入，变得潮湿。","pronunciation":["젇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5afee4a321606670fbbb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64729-1-16-2","ko":"네. 아까 물을 엎질러서 못 쓰게 됐어요.","zh":"是的。刚才不小心打翻了水，所以没法用了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물을","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"엎질러서","meaning":"撒，洒","explanation":"엎지르다：撒，洒；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"엎지르다","audio":"/audio/294818692426a52fe70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67526","senseId":"1","lemma":"엎지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰게","meaning":"用，使用","explanation":"쓰다：用，使用；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71285","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됐어요.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"15","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","a